    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the given <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>. In case no match could be\nfound an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> is returned.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配并应用给定<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的实体。如果未找到任何匹配项，则返回一个空的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> of entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>. In case no match could be found, an empty\n<a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> is returned.",
      "translation": "返回一个与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的实体 <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>。如果未找到匹配项，则返回一个空的 <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
